This is a good thing.I added dark mode to my blog a while ago and it was a little trying to do properly.You can implement a half-assed dark mode yourself by adding the following css.  @media(prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
    body {
      filter: invert();
    }
  }

All your images will be inverted as well, which doesn’t work well for photos.

